    "reviewNotes": "Exact English SM235 Eevee Cosmos PSA 7 cert 152476716, 1140x1925. Replaced the insufficient stock reference with the retained physical scan. Reviewed full source and clean master plus 4x tiles across the foil window. The large top blue disc and wing-side mauve disc are individually remeasured; restored missed circles and retained independently reviewed small round features. Rhyhorn face disc is visible in this copy; retain its own geometry with original TCGL composition. Rejected printed feathers, eyes, rock faces, foot highlights, sky rays, scratch streaks and the spurious 39-pixel rock-plane candidate. Dense unresolved specks and scratch intersections omitted. Registration: 319 inliers, 0.491-pixel median reprojection error; no master crop, UV offset or vertical flip. Printed master, coverage, protection and roughness remain byte-exact. Flat source and slab glare do not establish angular calibration; other copies differ.",
